DESCRIPTION:Speaking at Legatus Raleigh ("Strength in Surrender: Humility I
 n The Eucharist") / Speaking at Legatus Raleigh / Speaking at Legatus Ralei
 gh ("Strength in Surrender: Humility In The Eucharist") / Speaking at Legat
 us Raleigh ("Strength in Surrender: Humility In The Eucharist")\n\nStatus:
  Confirmed\nTravel block for Jason's Raleigh speaking engagement on Sep 24\
 , 2026.\nScreenshot from Jason shows the trip held Wednesday Sep 23 through
  Friday Sep 25\, 2026.\nRaleigh Legatus contact says Jason will stay at Hya
 tt Place Raleigh-Durham Airport\, 200 Airgate Dr\, Morrisville\, NC 27560.\
 nHotel ground transportation: Hyatt Place Raleigh-Durham Airport offers a c
 omplimentary shuttle to and from RDU\; use this for the Friday morning retu
 rn to the airport if needed.\nEvent locations: Mass at St. Joseph Catholic
  Church\, 2811 Poole Rd\, Raleigh\, NC 27610\; dinner at 400 Donald Ross Dr
 \, Raleigh\, NC 27610.\nGround plan update: Sue Ann confirmed they go right
  by RDU on the way to Raleigh and will pick Jason up at the airport for the
  meeting.\nLocal event transportation: hosts said they will provide transpo
 rtation from Mass to the dinner venue. Uber remains the recommended/reimbur
 sable fallback for any remaining local legs\, including transportation back
  to the hotel if not otherwise arranged.\nTiming note: current arrival at R
 DU is 4:54 PM on Thu Sep 24\, 2026\; local host pickup should make the 6:00
  PM Rosary/Confessions window and 6:20 PM Mass more workable if the flight
  is on time.\nLeticia will respond separately about receipts and any other
  details.\nSue Ann's phone number is saved privately with Clive\; do not pu
 blish it in the public travel feed.\n\nView live: https://jstravelschedule.
 netlify.app
